ts=2026-06-15T17:18:11.628Z type=context scope=pass-gui content="pass-gui: Desktop GUI for GNU Pass password manager. Stack: Vue 3.5 + Pinia 3 + NeutralinoJS 6.4 + TypeScript 5.9 + TailwindCSS 4 + shadcn-vue 2 + lib-result 5 + Zod 4 + Biome 2. pnpm workspace (root + client/). Auto-routing from pages/. Backend-first dev order: 1. Config/validation (DONE), 2. Readiness & env checks (IN PROGRESS), 3. Entry operations (NEXT), 4. Frontend (FUTURE), 5. Release (FAR FUTURE). Only Pinia store is counter stub. Only 3 pages: index (stub), about (stub), test (service debug). Full shadcn-vue sidebar suite installed but not wired. AppSidebar uses hardcoded sample data. dark/light mode works. No tests yet." tags=repo,architecture,tech-stack
ts=2026-06-15T17:18:13.361Z type=context scope=pass-gui content="Services layer: NeutralinoService (neu), PassService (pass), GpgService (gpg), ConfigService (config), StoreService (StoreService), fs (filesystem). All singletons. Early init in main.ts blocks app mount — known architectural issue. Error handling via lib-result Result<T,E>. Never throw for expected failures. Custom error classes: NeuError, ConfigError (with variants), DirectoryCreationError, FileWriteError. Command whitelist in neutralino.ts. Path traversal prevention via checkSneakyPath(). Services directory: client/src/services/." tags=services,architecture
ts=2026-06-15T17:18:15.535Z type=context scope=pass-gui content="Roadmap source of truth: 5 files in roadmap/ directory. Phase 1 (01-current-state-and-direction.md): Past scaffold, backend-first direction agreed. Phase 2 (02-backend-foundation-and-readiness.md): CURRENT FOCUS — readiness states (DEPENDENCIES_MISSING, GPG_NOT_INITIALIZED, STORE_NOT_FOUND, STORE_INVALID, READY), pipeline order (validate pass → GPG → resolve store → validate store → validate recipients → behavioral check → snapshot). Phase 3: entry listing/detail/mutations/clipboard. Phase 4: frontend (readiness-driven app entry, Pinia stores, core user flows). Phase 5: release hardening, packaging, maintenance." tags=roadmap,planning
ts=2026-06-15T17:18:16.608Z type=context scope=pass-gui content="Config system fully implemented: TOML via @ltd/j-toml with comment preservation. Zod schemas per section in config-validation.ts with cross-field validation (active_store must reference defined store). Default config in constants.ts. Platform-aware paths (Linux: ~/.config/pass-gui/config.toml, macOS: ~/Library/Application Support, Windows: %APPDATA%). Config validation done via validateAppConfig(). ConfigService has getValue/setValue with generics." tags=config,validation,done
ts=2026-06-15T17:18:18.581Z type=context scope=pass-gui content="What's NOT implemented (gaps): ReadinessState/ReadinessSnapshot/ReadinessIssue types, store-validation beyond .gpg-id existence check, .gpg-id parsing + recipient verification vs GPG keyring, readiness orchestrator service, pass ls behavioral check, readiness Pinia store, entry listing (pass ls parsing), entry detail retrieval (pass show), entry mutations (insert/generate/edit/rm/mv), clipboard logic, all Pinia stores beyond counter stub, frontend app shell, onboarding flows for missing deps, security hardening (clipboard clearing, memory clearing, GPG agent handling). Module-level init promises (neuInitialized, gpgInitialized, passInitialized) block app mount — known issue." tags=gaps,todo,readiness
ts=2026-06-15T17:18:20.511Z type=context scope=pass-gui content="Code style: Biome 2.3 linter + formatter (no ESLint/Prettier). 2 spaces, 80 char width, LF, double quotes in JSX/HTML, ES5 trailing commas, semicolons always. noVar: on, useImportType: error, noExplicitAny: info, noImportCycles: error, noEnum: warn. Vue files override: off for useConst, useImportType, noUnusedVariables, noUnusedImports. useSortedClasses: warn (nursery). type over interface. Named functions preferred. Composition API with <script setup lang=\"ts\">. Setup stores (function form) for Pinia. PascalCase.vue components, kebab-case composables." tags=code-style,biome,conventions
ts=2026-06-15T17:18:22.422Z type=context scope=pass-gui content="Types defined at client/src/types/: index.ts (Brand, Version, PassBinaryInfo, GpgBinaryInfo, SecretKey, AllowedCommand, OsType, etc.), config.ts (AppConfig, CoreConfig, StoreConfig, etc. with generics for type-safe key/value access), toml.ts (TomlObject, Table, ParsedToml, TomlStringified). Plans at docs/plans/: backend-readiness-phase.md (active readiness execution plan), code-review-findings.md (archive, 6 resolved + 3 deferred), review-fixes.md (appears applied), default-config-comments.md (partially implemented). docs/specs/backend-readiness.md (readiness phase spec)." tags=types,plans,docs
